      "name": "Two Slot Extended Mags",
      "slug": "two-slot-extended-mags",
      "teaser": "Makes 40-45 round extended mags only take 2 slots in the inventory instead of 3!",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/1241.png",
      "downloads": 52196,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<p>Finally making them a more viable option before getting quad stack 60 rounders.</p>\n<p>Also prevents the base gun from being an extra row taller in the inventory when an extended mag is inserted.</p>\n<p>If you want the 100 round STANAG to also be 2 slots tall, set config.json -&gt; maxMagazineCapacityToBeIncluded to 100.</p>\n<p><strong>Installation:</strong></p>\n<p>Copy contents of zip file to &lt;spt-dir&gt;/user/mods.</p>\n<p><strong>Also clean Temp files using the Aki.Launcher settings in the top right to get updated icons for the new slot size!</strong></p>\n",
      "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/917/two-slot-extended-mags",
